+full model, respectively.  Those results make a fixed-small-K planted family
+ineligible for Track A, but they provide an honest Track-B mechanical route.
+
+The module stays in the paper's native objects.  The initial tournament is
+transitive in a displayed order.  Every primitive construction consists of a
+length-(L+1) unit-step interval of reversal indices and its length-L interior;
+all common updates occur twice, leaving one boundary reversal.  Target
+boundaries occur once and decoy boundaries occur twice modulo n.  The known
+odd boundaries give a feedback arc set because deleting those reversed arcs
+leaves a subgraph of the original transitive tournament.  This is composition
+of involutive identities, not a search over feedback sets.
