+        "A JSON list of exactly K distinct directed fixed-gap chord arcs "
+        "[tail,head] of the final n-vertex tournament, sorted lexicographically, "
+        "with endpoints in 0..n-1; deleting them must leave an acyclic digraph."
+    ),
+    "bounds": {
