+    "intuition_type": "invariant",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "Arc reversal is an involution, so overlapping unit-step update batches "
+        "cancel by parity and only unmatched boundary arcs affect the final "
+        "tournament; without this invariant one must replay every update."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: literal expansion and replay of every reversal followed by "
+        "comparison with the displayed transitive order is O(U+n^2), and the "
+        "paper's Section 3 generic query is O(3^K K log^2 n); at the hard "
+        "preset the reference replay cost is measured by selftest at about 1.6 "
