+Paper grounding and Step 0.  Section 1 defines a tournament and feedback arc
+set, and Section 3/Appendix B gives Algorithm 1: find a directed triangle and
+branch on its three arcs.  Fact 0.A.3 says a tournament is acyclic exactly
+when it has no directed triangle.  Definition 0.A.2 defines a back arc by the
+indegree order, while Fact 0.A.4 characterizes acyclic tournaments through
+singleton indegree buckets.  Those are precisely the objects exposed here:
+the final tournament and two read-only probes of its maintained buckets.
 
