codex
Implemented a native Track B dynamic FAST generator based on the paper’s arc-reversal model and \(O(3^K K\log^2 n)\) full-model algorithm. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2404.12907v1)

Key results:

- All local G1–G9(c) gates pass.
- G4: 0/200,000 valid-shape guesses.
- G6: five attacks each 0/8; reference range-XOR solver 8/8.
- Hard preset: \(n=8191\), fixed eight-arc witness.
- Reference cost: 8,793 operations.
- Compact route: 184 operations.
- Answer size: 95 characters, 16 atoms.

